                        "review": "The game says that I have played 10 hours, it is much more than that, most of it was offline on a handheld. \n\nAnyways, Samurai Gunn is a fantastic game. It is one of the few fighting games I would describe as \"perfect\". This game is a ton of fun to play with friends and with family. If you are playing it with younger ones, there is an option to change the blood to \"flowers, if you have an aversion to blood y effects. \n\nI have played this with many friends, all enjoyed it greatly, and have purchased it after playing it with me. \n\nI have also played it with my son. We have so much fun playing it together! \n\nI very much recommend this game for people looking for a casual game like Super Smash Bros, but want a Samurai approach to it. \n\nI rate this game 10/10 - even the faults of some of the levels, the quality is so high. [b] This game is one of, if not the best fighting games ever made. [/b]",
